{"title": "War Caster: Concentration", "pageid": 21507, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/War_Caster:_Concentration", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:War_Caster_Concentration.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/War_Caster_Concentration.webp/300px-War_Caster_Concentration.webp, /w/images/3/3d/War_Caster_Concentration.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/War_Caster_Concentration.webp/300px-War_Caster_Concentration.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/War_Caster_Concentration.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>War Caster Concentration</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/War_Caster\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"War Caster\">War Caster</a> Feat. Users of this feature have <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> maintaining a spell with Concentration.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> to maintain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> on a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">Spell</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/War_Caster\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"War Caster\">War Caster</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bert_Adams\" title=\"Bert Adams\">Bert Adams</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blunder_Bob\" title=\"Blunder Bob\">Blunder Bob</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Far%27aag\" title=\"Far'aag\">Far'aag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/For%27reth\" title=\"For'reth\">For'reth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghush%27ins\" title=\"Ghush'ins\">Ghush'ins</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\">Golbraith Stredivas</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\">Jeera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight_Sliver\" title=\"Moonlight Sliver\">Moonlight Sliver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Redcap_Blood_Sage\" title=\"Redcap Blood Sage\">Redcap Blood Sage</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Redcap_Mystic_Cannoneer\" title=\"Redcap Mystic Cannoneer\">Redcap Mystic Cannoneer</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Therezzyn\" title=\"Therezzyn\">Therezzyn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Tska'an</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Toes_Rischer\" title=\"Two-Toes Rischer\">Two-Toes Rischer</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Umr%27a%27ac\" title=\"Umr'a'ac\">Umr'a'ac</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wanda_Tullermoor\" title=\"Wanda Tullermoor\">Wanda Tullermoor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yy%27rul\" title=\"Yy'rul\">Yy'rul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zhendila\" title=\"Zhendila\">Zhendila</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202246\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 916/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5203/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2533/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1300/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 729000/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion e